                                                "example_id": "ee27dce3-e977-438d-903e-465c3ccf47e1",
                                                "sense_id": "5d10ba29-d569-3694-a80e-18a8f39ac9ca",
                                                "text": "2003, Jinhee Choi, \"Fits and Startles: Cognitivism Revisited,\" The Journal of Aesthetics and Art Criticism, vol. 61, no. 2 (Spring), p. 152,\nSubjects report the physiological arousals induced by adrenaline and placebo differently."
